{"words": [{"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "Those"}, {"text": "ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ", "translation": "We have given them"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "يَتْلُونَهُۥ", "translation": "recite it"}, {"text": "حَقَّ", "translation": "(as it has the) right"}, {"text": "تِلَاوَتِهِۦٓ", "translation": "(of) its recitation"}, {"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "Those (people)"}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "believe"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ ۗ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "وَمَن", "translation": "And whoever"}, {"text": "يَكْفُرْ", "translation": "disbelieves"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "then those"}, {"text": "هُمُ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "ٱلْخَـٰسِرُونَ", "translation": "(are) the losers"}], "sahih": "Those to whom We have given the Book recite it with its true recital.1 They [are the ones who] believe in it. And whoever disbelieves in it - it is they who are the losers."}